{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那就麻煩喊口號了，那個……」", "text_idx": 441, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "mc0346", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "老師故意不看瀨名同學，而是向我投來求救的眼神。", "text_idx": 466, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "明明瀨名同學的氣勢跟以前比已經柔和許多了，她還是很怕跟她說話的樣子。", "text_idx": 457, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然我也想幫她……", "text_idx": 473, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「起立！！」", "text_idx": 431, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 452, "voice": "ar0219", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「敬禮！」", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「辛、辛苦了！」", "text_idx": 433, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "mc0347", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "老師連忙低下頭。", "text_idx": 467, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一進入下課時間，教室中立刻充滿喧鬧聲。", "text_idx": 445, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，抱歉。有一件事我忘記說了……」", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "mc0348", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那個～各位～請聽我說～」", "text_idx": 440, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "mc0349", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "老師很困擾的樣子。", "text_idx": 465, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "沒辦法。", "text_idx": 462, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「大家──」", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「還有事情要宣布，大家請安靜。」", "text_idx": 438, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 452, "voice": "ar5507", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不愧是她……", "text_idx": 447, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "沒有大喊大叫，只是自然地說話而已，就讓吵鬧的教室立刻寂靜無聲。", "text_idx": 461, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那個，因為快到期末考了，各位請努力用功喔！」", "text_idx": 439, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "mc0350", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「考試範圍在課堂上講過了，還不知道的人請來問我。」", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "mc0351", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要說的就是以上嗎？」", "text_idx": 426, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 452, "voice": "ar5508", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是、是的，這樣就說完了。」", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "mc0352", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "萬智老師逃跑般離開教室。", "text_idx": 469, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……還是一樣呢。」", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": "ht1128", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太走到我的座位旁，看向老師離開的門。", "text_idx": 472, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「她講課很容易懂也很有趣，稍微有點自信也可以的說……」", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊。如果聲音能再大聲一點，比較容易聽到就太好了。」", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": "ht1129", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為個性使然吧。」", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果是這層意思，瀨名同學或許很適合當老師。」", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": "ht1130", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「為什麼你覺得我適合？」", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 452, "voice": "ar5509", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名同學調侃地問。", "text_idx": 463, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「說人人到，瀨名同學耳朵真好呢。」", "text_idx": 428, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": "ht1131", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太苦笑一下。", "text_idx": 471, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「應該不是因為我是學園長的女兒這種理由吧？」", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 452, "voice": "ar5510", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「跟那個沒關係吧。」", "text_idx": 432, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就像剛才，妳一句話就讓教室安靜下來了吧？」", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": "ht1132", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「說有事要宣布，大家就會聽了吧？」", "text_idx": 429, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 452, "voice": "ar5511", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我覺得不是那個原因……」", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": "ht1133", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是嗎？畢竟跟期末考有關，要是沒聽到吃虧的還是自己不是嗎？」", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 452, "voice": "ar5512", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「感覺時間過得好快呢。」", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不久前才覺得合併試辦剛開始而已，現在已經到期末了。」", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": "ht1134", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……說的也是呢。」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎麼了，你很少這樣緊張的感覺耶。」", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": "ht1135", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「該不會是玩過頭了？」", "text_idx": 427, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 452, "voice": "ar5513", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我沒有玩，我都有在念書的……」", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「顆顆顆，呼哈哈哈哈哈！」", "text_idx": 443, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "sn2186", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「終於、終於等到剝掉瓜生騙人面具的時刻了！」", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "sn2187", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「剝掉騙人面具？」", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": "ht1136", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生的面具戴得很牢固還黏很緊對吧？」", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "sn2188", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以我要親手把它剝下來！」", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "sn2189", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎麼剝？」", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「期末考等著看吧！這次我要用壓倒性的差距把你比下去！」", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "sn2190", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "乾同學氣勢如虹地指著我。", "text_idx": 449, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……請手下留情。」", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我會盡全力不會客氣的，你放心吧！」", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "sn2191", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我不是那個意思。」", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好了，那就趕快回家用功──之前得去美羽學姊那裡呢！」", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "sn2192", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「再見！」", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "sn2193", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "乾同學很快就跑走了。", "text_idx": 448, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……她想說什麼呢？」", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": "ht1137", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「應該是想說考試彼此都加油吧？」", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真是不坦率啊，小乾。」", "text_idx": 422, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": "ht1138", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊。」", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 452, "voice": "ar5514", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……不過，這次沒有來呢。」", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什麼沒來？」", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 452, "voice": "ar5515", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「每次這樣聊天時，安潔好像都會突然出現……」", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你這麼一說……好像是。如果她加入聊天，我本來想像期中考時一樣徹底指導她的說。」", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 452, "voice": "ar5516", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我好像知道安潔沒來的理由了。", "text_idx": 454, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「先不說安潔，你這次怎麼樣？」", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 452, "voice": "ar5517", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「應該沒問題，我會自己努力的。」", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我知道了，那就彼此加油吧。」", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 452, "voice": "ar5518", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「雖然問題解決了，但立刻就遇到考試啊。時機點真糟糕。」", "text_idx": 442, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": "ht1139", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「時機？」", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「兩個人的時間都要被考試佔去了。」", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": "ht1140", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊。」", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……你很坦然呢。」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": "ht1141", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為我們決定不勉強自己。」", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「照自己的步調慢慢前進就好了。」", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……那樣好像比較好。」", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": "ht1142", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥。」", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 459, "voice": "sk3056", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "櫻乃來到我們的教室。", "text_idx": 460, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我現在過去。」", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。」", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 459, "voice": "sk3057", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔想過了！」", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag3574", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「逃跑也是沒用的話，一開始乖乖被逮就好了對吧？」", "text_idx": 434, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag3575", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「比起考試時後悔，趁現在熬過恐懼傷口會比較淺才對！」", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag3576", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「兩邊都是傷痕累累？」", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 459, "voice": "sk3058", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……什麼意思啊？」", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 452, "voice": "ar5519", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。安潔也要一起用功是吧？歡迎妳喔！」", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的，那就接受你的好意了！」", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag3577", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「葛格，四個人怎麼辦？」", "text_idx": 425, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 459, "voice": "sk3059", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「女孩子比較多，去櫻乃的房間可以嗎？」", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。我有整理過了。」", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 459, "voice": "sk3060", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉，因為安潔突然來打擾……」", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag3578", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「大家一起用功就不可怕了。」", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 459, "voice": "sk3061", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「說的也是呢！現在要好好用功準備考試才行！」", "text_idx": 430, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag3579", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「之前低空飛過了。這次一定也可以！」", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag3580", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒錯。安潔要成為肯努力就辦得到的女僕！」", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag3581", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安潔在胸口握拳展示決心。", "text_idx": 451, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔，比起肯努力就辦得到的女僕，隨時都能辦到的女僕比較好不是嗎？」", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 452, "voice": "ar5520", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為那個現在有點難，所以從能做到的事開始一步一腳印！」", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag3582", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「感覺是積極地消極呢。」", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……好吧，那就開始了。」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 452, "voice": "ar5521", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我吃飽了。」", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不客氣，只是簡單的東西！」", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag3583", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這裡廚房很大真好呢。」", "text_idx": 437, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 452, "voice": "ar5522", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的，可以三個人一起動手，很方便做料理呢。」", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag3584", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，大家一起做好開心。」", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 459, "voice": "sk3062", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「剛才麻煩妳們煮菜了，收拾就交給我吧。」", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這一點請放心！已經幾乎都收拾好了！」", "text_idx": 435, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag3585", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只剩下用的碗盤而已。」", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 452, "voice": "ar5523", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……真厲害。」", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為有櫻乃學妹、愛理同學。」", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag3586", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔在這裡感覺身為女僕派不上用場，有點沮喪。」", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag3587", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎麼會，妳真的幫了很多忙。」", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "料理和收拾當然也是，但她一定做了更多。", "text_idx": 455, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「感覺家裡到處都變乾淨了，是安潔打掃的吧？」", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的！安潔有特地偷偷做，沒想到還是被發現了，安潔的修行還不夠。」", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag3588", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我還想說妳有時候會跑不見，原來是去做那些事了？」", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 452, "voice": "ar5524", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「想、想說用功的時候也需要轉換心情，感覺怎麼樣呢？」", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag3589", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我懂。考試期間房間總是乾乾淨淨。」", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 459, "voice": "sk3063", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好吧，我也懂妳的心情，而且今天的目標也達成了。」", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 452, "voice": "ar5525", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「明天呢？」", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 459, "voice": "sk3064", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉。我或許會有事，明天再決定好嗎？」", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 452, "voice": "ar5526", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，我知道了。」", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 459, "voice": "sk3065", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔呢？」", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔配合愛理同學的預定。」", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag3590", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這樣嗎？」", "text_idx": 436, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的，因為不想打擾兩位。」", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag3591", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我們互看一眼，安潔對我微笑。", "text_idx": 453, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
